lor":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-12-05T11:49:34Z","updated_at":"2025-12-05T14:24:58Z","closed_at":"2025-12-05T13:22:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.6-dev5\n- Not Reproducible in Godot 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nLinux (Arch) x84_64 - Godot v4.6-dev5 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf Godot is set to use \"Jolt Physics\" and Physics \"Run on Separate Thread\" is true, Godot Editor will freeze if a HingeJoint3D is present in a scene which is hooked up to a StaticBody3D and RigidBody3D.\nOnce NodeA and NodeB get assigned to the HingeJoint3D (order of assignment is not important), the Editor freezes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Create a new project.\n* In Project settings, set Physics Engine to \"Jolt Physics\" and \"Run on Separate Thread\" to TRUE.\n* Create a new StaticBody3D scene with a collider attached to it\n* Add a RigidBody3D with a collider attached to it\n* Add a HingeJoint3D \n* Now assign StaticBody3D to NodeA of HingeJoint3D\n* Now assign RigidBody3D to NodeB of HingeJoint3D\n* Result: Once NodeB is assigned, the Editor will freeze.\n* NOTE: You can also assign RigidBody3D to NodeB first. In this case, the Editor freezes once StaticBody3D is assigned to NodeA.\n* If \"Run on Separate Thread\" is set to FALSE, things will work as expected\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI've created a Minimum Reproduction Project to demonstrate the issue:\n[mrp-hinge.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23960569/mrp-hinge.zip)\n\nSteps to reproduce in this project:\n* Load the project\n* Open the scene \"hinge-body.tscn\"\n* In that scene, select HingeJoint3D and assign RigidBody3D to NodeB (NodeA should already be assigned).\n* Result: The Editor will freeze.\n* If you open the Editor again, head to Project Settings and turn \"Run on Separate Thread\" off, it will work as expected.\n* NOTE: Pressing Play on scene that will instantiate such a problematic HingeJoint scene will also cause the Editor to freeze. ","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113620/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113620/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}